   {
    "id": "blockquote_00002",
    "type": "blockquote",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     2,
     13
    ],
    "text": "fputs — put a string on a stream",
    "placeholders": {},
    "context": null
   },
   {
    "id": "h4_00003",
    "type": "h4",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     2,
     15
    ],
    "text": "[A2][/A2]SYNOPSIS",
    "placeholders": {
     "A2": {
      "open": "<a name=\"tag_17_177_02\" id=\"tag_17_177_02\">",
      "close": "</a>",
      "translate": true
     }
    },
    "context": null
   },
   {
    "id": "p_00004",
    "type": "p",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     2,
     17,
     1
    ],
    "text": "[CODE3]",
    "placeholders": {
     "CODE3": {
      "open": "",
      "close": "",
      "translate": false,
      "raw": "<code><tt>#include &lt;<a href=\"../basedefs/stdio.h.html\">stdio.h</a>&gt;<br>\n<br>\nint fputs(const char *restrict</tt> <i>s</i><tt>, FILE *restrict</tt> <i>stream</i><tt>);<br></tt></code>"
     }
    },
    "context": null
   },
   {
    "id": "h4_00005",
    "type": "h4",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     2,
     19
    ],
    "text": "[A4][/A4]DESCRIPTION",
    "placeholders": {
     "A4": {
      "open": "<a name=\"tag_17_177_03\" id=\"tag_17_177_03\">",
      "close": "</a>",
      "translate": true
     }
    },
    "context": null
   },
   {
    "id": "p_00006",
    "type": "p",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     2,
     21,
     3
    ],
    "text": "The [I5]fputs[/I5]() function shall write the null-terminated string pointed to by [I6]s[/I6] to the stream pointed to by\n[I7]stream[/I7]. The terminating null byte shall not be written.",
    "placeholders": {
     "I5": {
      "open": "<i>",
      "close": "</i>",
      "translate": true
     },
     "I6": {
      "open": "<i>",
      "close": "</i>",
      "translate": true
     },
     "I7": {
      "open": "<i>",
      "close": "</i>",
      "translate": true
     }
    },
    "context": null
   },
   {
    "id": "p_00007",
    "type": "p",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     2,
     21,
     5
    ],
    "text": "[S8][[A9]CX[/A9]][/S8] [IMG10] The\nlast data modification and last file status change timestamps of the file shall be marked for update between the successful\nexecution of [I11]fputs[/I11]() and the next successful completion of a call to [A12][I13]fflush[/I13]()[/A12]\nor [A14][I15]fclose[/I15]()[/A14] on the same stream or a call to [A16][I17]exit[/I17]()[/A16] or [A18][I19]abort[/I19]()[/A18]. [IMG20]",
    "placeholders": {
     "S8": {
      "open": "<sup>",
      "close": "</sup>",
      "translate": true
     },
     "A9": {
      "open": "<a href=\"javascript:open_code(&#x27;CX&#x27;)\">",
      "close": "</a>",
      "translate": true
     },
     "IMG10": {
