   {
    "id": "h4_00008",
    "type": "h4",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     2,
     23
    ],
    "text": "[A21][/A21]RETURN VALUE",
    "placeholders": {
     "A21": {
      "open": "<a name=\"tag_17_177_04\" id=\"tag_17_177_04\">",
      "close": "</a>",
      "translate": true
     }
    },
    "context": null
   },
   {
    "id": "p_00009",
    "type": "p",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     2,
     25,
     1
    ],
    "text": "Upon successful completion, [I22]fputs[/I22]() shall return a non-negative number. Otherwise, it shall return EOF, set an error\nindicator for the stream, [S23][[A24]CX[/A24]][/S23] [IMG25] &nbsp;and set [I26]errno[/I26] to indicate the error. [IMG27]",
    "placeholders": {
     "I22": {
      "open": "<i>",
      "close": "</i>",
      "translate": true
     },
     "S23": {
      "open": "<sup>",
      "close": "</sup>",
      "translate": true
     },
     "A24": {
      "open": "<a href=\"javascript:open_code(&#x27;CX&#x27;)\">",
      "close": "</a>",
      "translate": true
     },
     "IMG25": {
      "open": "",
      "close": "",
      "translate": false,
      "raw": "<img src=\"../images/opt-start.gif\" alt=\"[Option Start]\" border=\"0\">"
     },
